/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (            Accreditation pushes institutions to meet and maintain their high standards, in turn increasing trust and confidence in them among the public and boosting accountability. Accreditation is a tool that stakeholders use to monitor, assess, and evaluate the standards and quality of the education a student receives at an institution of higher learning. In this process, Alagappa University is in the fourth cycle of NAAC accreditation, and all the stakeholders are expected to work and prove their achievements with the highest credentials under the able leadership of the Honourable Vice Chancellor, Prof. G. Ravi.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
272 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (                 Alagappa University, in its quality journey in higher education, shall prove its bench marks through its outcomes for the development of students and the nation with the continued blessings of founder Vallal Dr. RM. Alagappar. The Ithazhi e magazine of journalism and mass communication joins with all other stakeholders in the accreditation process of the university and assures to involve them with commitment and dedication, as carried out by the Honourable Vice Chancellor, Prof. G. Ravi. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
273 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (             This issue is witnessing the Pongal Celebrations, where everyone expresses their sense of gratitude to agriculture and farm animals at the end of the harvest season, a unique pride of Tamil Nadu, and wishes everyone. Ithazhi astonishing that the future parliamentarians performed and ruled India at Alagappa University in a disciplined democratic way in the youth parliament. Ithazhi had a positive outlook on our future India after witnessing the Youth Parliament at Alagappa University. Ithazhi is proud that all the family members of Alagappa University have pledged to vote in an honest way for the development of the nation without any bias or prejudice in the coming elections.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
274 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (             It is the right time to work hard to showcase our achievements and vote honestly in the forthcoming elections. Ithazhi wishes you all.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
