/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Department of Journalism and Mass Communication organized and conducted the Pongal celebration on January 11, 2024, to celebrate the culture of the Tamil community. Students arranged to bring Jallikattu Bull with the motive of creating awareness about the sport. Students gathered in traditional attire, prepared sweet Pongal, and celebrated it according to the traditions. They conducted various games that reflected Tamil traditions. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
