303 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The students of the Department of Journalism and Mass Communication observed silence in the memory of those who sacrificed their lives during the struggle for Indian freedom from 11.00 AM to 11.02 AM on January 30, 2024, and took a pledge against untouchability. This pledge reminds us to live, accept, and respect people beyond their differences. Students were informed about the severity of untouchability in the history of our country. They were educated about the fundamental rights of people and the constitutional aids against untouchability)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
304 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Department of Journalism and Mass Communication conducted a workshop entitled Contemporary Television Editing Techniques by Thiru. S. Iyappan, Editor at Sun TV, Alagappa Alumni, on February 1, 2024. Dr. N. Arunachalam, Head of the Department, Department of Journalism and Mass Communication, welcomed the gathering and spoke about the difference in editing practices in the olden days and the present age. Thiru. S. Iyappan, Editor at Sun TV, lectured the students about various techniques used in television editing. The students had a quality interaction session with the Alagappa alumni and gained insights into the industry standards of editing. He offered guidance to the students regarding employability and successful sustainability in the field. Mrs. K. Nirosa Devi, Teaching Assistant, Department of Journalism and Mass Communication, thanked the guest lecturer and participants of the workshop.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
