309 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Department of Lifelong Learning, in collaboration with the Department of Journalism and Mass Communication, conducted a lecture on life skills and media education by Prof. Mohammod Moninoor Roshid, Professor, University of Dhaka, Bangladesh, on February 1, 2024. Dr. N. Johnson, Head of the Department, Department of Lifelong Learning, welcomed the gathering and spoke about the importance of learning various life skills needed for media employment. Prof. Mohammod Moninoor Roshid, Professor, University of Dhaka, Bangladesh, provided insights on the functioning of media in Bangladesh and the life skills that are taught in media education. He shared his own life experiences with the students during interaction session. Dr. N. Arunachalam, Head of the Department, Department of Journalism and Mass Communication, expressed his gratitude and offered valuable advice to the students on improving their life skills.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
