/ActualText (Tamil Panpattu Mayyam of Alagappa University conducted various competitions on account of World Mother Tongue Day on February 14, 2024. Selvi. R. Ashika Jasmine received 2nd place in the painting competition and Thiru. R. Abhimanyu received 1st place in the elocution competition. They received their certificates of excellence from Prof. G. Ravi, vice chancellor of Alagappa University, on February 21, 2024, at the convocation seminar hall at the World Mother Tongue Day event. )
