/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Thiru. M. Murugesan, a poet,  explained his experience as a journalist in Tamil newspapers and magazines and gained more knowledge in expressing a piece of information effectively in Tamil. Dr. Tamil Silambarasan, a film director, advised the students to explore their talents and learn the minute tricks of that trade. He spoke about Isaipriya \(journalist\) and successful film-makers like Lenin Bharathi and shared valuable insights from their experience.  He initiated an interaction session with the students. Prof.  A. Senthilrajan, Registrar of Alagappa University and Dr. S. Rajaram, Head of the Department, Department of Tamil felicitated the gathering. Dr. M. Tamilarasan, Teaching Assistant, Department of Fine Arts expressed his gratitude to the dignitaries participated and other participants of the event. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [11]
