/T (Challenges and Opportunities: Despite these achievements, Indian sports also faced several challenges in 2024. Issues such as lack of infrastructure, inadequate funding, and limited access to training facilities continued to hinder the growth of sports in the country. However, efforts were made at both the governmental and organizational levels to address these challenges and create a more conducive environment for athletes.)
/E (Challenges and Opportunities: Despite these achievements, Indian sports also faced several challenges in 2024. Issues such as lack of infrastructure, inadequate funding, and limited access to training facilities continued to hinder the growth of sports in the country. However, efforts were made at both the governmental and organizational levels to address these challenges and create a more conducive environment for athletes.)
