428 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Future Prospects: Looking ahead, Indian sports are poised for further growth and success. With the government's focus on promoting sports at the grassroots level and initiatives to support elite athletes, the future looks promising for Indian sports. The upcoming events such as the Commonwealth Games and the Asian Games provide an opportunity for Indian athletes to shine on the global stage.)
/E (Future Prospects: Looking ahead, Indian sports are poised for further growth and success. With the government's focus on promoting sports at the grassroots level and initiatives to support elite athletes, the future looks promising for Indian sports. The upcoming events such as the Commonwealth Games and the Asian Games provide an opportunity for Indian athletes to shine on the global stage.)
/Pg 19 0 R
